NATIONAL ASSEMBLY SECRETARIAT
ORDERS OF THE DAYfor the meeting of the National Assembly to be held on Thursday, the 10th Aprll, 2025 at 11.00 a.m.L. Tilowot, Hodith, Noot and national anthem.QUESTIONS
Questions entered in a separate list to be asked and answers given.CALLING ATTENTION NOTICE
3. M5. SHARMITA SAHIBA FARUQUI HASHAAM MR. ASAD ALAM NIAZIMR. MUHAMMAD SHAHARYAR KHAN MAHAR MR. KHURSHID AHMED JUNEJOMR. RAMESH tAL to invite attention of the Minister forPlanning, Development and Special lnitiatives to a matter of urgent public importance regarding non-inclusion of the Hyderabad-Su kku r Motorway project in the PSDP for the fiscal year,2024-25, causinggrave concern amongst the public.
RESOLUTION
4. SYED MOHSIN RAZA NAQVI, Minister for lnterior and Narcotics Control to move the followingResolution:-
"That the National Assembly resolves to extend the Societies Registration (Amendment)Ordinance, 2024 lxl of 2O241for a further period of one hundred and twenty days w.e.f. 27thApril, 2O25 under proviso to sub-paragraph (ii) of paragraph (a) of clause (2) of Article 89 of theConstitution of the lslamic Republic of Pakistan".LEGISLATIVE BUSINESS
5. MR. KHAIID MAQBOOL SlDDlQUl, Minister for Federal Education and Professional Training,to move that the Bill further to amend the Federal Board of lntermediate and Secondary EducationAct, L975 [The Federal Board of lntermediate and Secondary Education (Amendment) Bill,2O24l, asreported by the Standing Committee, be taken into consideration at once.
6. MR. KHALID MAQBOOL SlDDlQUl, Minister for Federal Education and Professional Training,to move that the Bill further to amend the Federal Board of lntermediate and Secondary EducationAct, 1975 [The Federal Board of lntermediate and Secondary Education (Amendment) Bill,2O24), bepa ssed.7. DR. TARIQ tAZAt CHAUDHARY, Minister for Parliamentary Affairs, to move that the Bill toamend the Special Technology Zones Authority Act, 2021 [The Special Technology Zones Authority(Amendment) 8il1,20251, as passed by the Senate, be taken into consideration at once.
8. DR. TARIQ FAZAL CHAUDHARY, Minister for Parliamentary Affairs, to move that the Bill toamend the Special Technology Zones Authority Acl, 2027 [The Special Technology Zones Authority(Amendment) Bill, 20251, be passed.PRESENTATION OF PERIODICAL REPORTS OF THE STANDING COMMITTEE
9. NAWABZADA IFTIKHAR AHMED KHAN BABAR, Chairman Standing Committee on Aviation, topresent the Periodical Report of the Committee for the period 7't luly,2024 to 31st December, 2024,as required by rule 234-4 ofthe Rules of Procedure and Conduct of Business in the National Assembly,2007.

